            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Kontakt Artwork 1.0</h2><ul>
<li>First release.</li>
<li>Give any Kontakt library a proper 420x316 tile and 1280x212 banner.</li>
<li>Covers found for you, drag one in and install.</li>
<li>Reorder the Default view and save arrangements as scenes.</li>
<li>Back artwork, originals, order and scenes up to iCloud, Dropbox or any folder.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
